1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,100
The thieves' guild keeps its own roads.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,475
Underground.

3
00:00:06,475 --> 00:00:08,650
Unmapped.

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:11,675
They call it the Bifrost.

5
00:00:11,675 --> 00:00:16,700
Every road in the Bifrost hides a wall that isn't a wall.

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:21,950
Behind each one, a sanctuary known only to thieves.

7
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:29,700
Cicada, the spy network of the Paladins of Parabellum, has spent years trying to get inside.

8
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:34,200
Only one infiltration has ever been reported.

9
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,825
Agent Kat.

10
00:00:36,825 --> 00:00:40,825
Agent Kat's report describes something odd.

11
00:00:40,825 --> 00:00:44,250
At every station: a challenge.

12
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:46,975
And a password.

13
00:00:46,975 --> 00:00:51,725
Captured thieves insist it's just extra security.

14
00:00:51,725 --> 00:00:55,000
Cicada isn't convinced.

15
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,425
If only thieves know the way in...

16
00:00:58,425 --> 00:01:04,300
who is the password for?
